---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact Save Room for retro gaming, PC hardware, sponsorship, and collaboration opportunities." breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Contact', path: '/contact' }]}>
  <section class="contact-hero container"><div class="eyebrow">Open channel</div><h1>Got a cartridge<br /><em>to share?</em></h1><p>For retro gaming, PC hardware, sponsorships, or collaboration ideas, start from the official Save Room channel.</p><a class="button button--dark" href="https://www.youtube.com/@saveroomorg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Start with the channel ↗</a></section>
  <section class="contact-card container"><div><div class="eyebrow">For partnerships</div><h2>Keep it nerdy.<br />Keep it useful.</h2></div><div><p>Use the contact details listed on the official YouTube About page for business inquiries and channel collaborations.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/@saveroomorg/about" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Visit the channel About page ↗</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.contact-hero{padding-top:100px;padding-bottom:110px}.contact-hero h1{margin:24px 0}.contact-hero h1 em{color:var(--terracotta);font-style:normal}.contact-hero>p{max-width:46ch;font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:30px}.contact-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;padding:60px;margin-bottom:100px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,79,216,.2),rgba(39,245,255,.12)),var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.contact-card h2{margin:16px 0}.contact-card p{max-width:35ch;color:var(--muted)}.text-link{color:var(--coral);font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.9rem}@media(max-width:680px){.contact-hero{padding-top:70px;padding-bottom:80px}.contact-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:35px;margin-bottom:70px}}
</style>
